{
  "description": "R3: the capture view lists the captured resource's backlinks newest first: exactly the 3 seeded ones, never the decoy; a fourth, newer backlink appears first after the view reopens",
  "requirement": "R3 (GPUI Phase 1)",
  "notes": [
    "setup.graph seeds the instance's ubilink-graph.sqlite with graph-backlinks.json exactly as the core's import_json would write it (probes/README.md, seed_graph). Link timestamps are distinct; the decoy is a captured resource with no link to the subject.",
    "capture-subject.json captures the graph's subject (an https URI, so the core's capture validation admits it).",
    "Each backlink row is a ListItem whose subtree carries the resource's name and URI as text (deep match, README contract); the sequence is asserted on URIs AND on names, so an over-truncated URI label cannot make the order pass by its common 'https:' prefix.",
    "seed_graph merges graph-backlinks-newer.json into the live graph (one more resource, one newer link); the view must re-query when it reopens."
  ],
  "setup": {
    "graph": "graph-backlinks.json",
    "fixtures": {
      "capture": "capture-subject.json"
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "graph seeded: 3 backlinks + decoy",
      "graph": true,
      "link_count": 3,
      "resource_count": 5
    },
    {
      "name": "capture the subject",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "capture"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "capture"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "subject captured",
      "see": {
        "role": "Label",
        "text": "https://subject.example/note"
      },
      "route": "capture",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "exactly the 3 backlinks, newest first (URIs and names)",
      "see": [
        {
          "sequence": {
            "role": "ListItem",
            "texts": [
              "https://gamma.example/three",
              "https://beta.example/two",
              "https://alpha.example/one"
            ],
            "mode": "exact",
            "deep": true
          }
        },
        {
          "sequence": {
            "role": "ListItem",
            "texts": [
              "Gamma Doc",
              "Beta Post",
              "Alpha Paper"
            ],
            "mode": "exact",
            "deep": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "route": "capture",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "name": "the decoy is not listed",
      "see": [
        {
          "text": "https://decoy.example/unrelated"
        },
        {
          "text": "Decoy Unrelated"
        }
      ],
      "absent": true,
      "route": "capture"
    },
    {
      "name": "a fourth, newer backlink lands in the graph",
      "seed_graph": "graph-backlinks-newer.json"
    },
    {
      "graph": true,
      "link_count": 4,
      "resource_count": 6
    },
    {
      "name": "close the view",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "capture"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": false,
        "route": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "reopen it",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "capture"
      },
      "expect": {
        "shell.visible": true,
        "route": "capture"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "the newer backlink comes first, then the other three",
      "see": [
        {
          "sequence": {
            "role": "ListItem",
            "texts": [
              "https://delta.example/four",
              "https://gamma.example/three",
              "https://beta.example/two",
              "https://alpha.example/one"
            ],
            "mode": "exact",
            "deep": true
          }
        },
        {
          "sequence": {
            "role": "ListItem",
            "texts": [
              "Delta Memo",
              "Gamma Doc",
              "Beta Post",
              "Alpha Paper"
            ],
            "mode": "exact",
            "deep": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "route": "capture",
      "timeout_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "see": {
        "text": "https://decoy.example/unrelated"
      },
      "absent": true,
      "route": "capture"
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing launched",
      "call": "opened",
      "expect": {
        "": {
          "eq": []
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
